## Out of scope for phase8 (intentionally deferred)

- **Per-user document ownership in Postgres** — `documents.user_id` column + `user_id` filter in `retrieve_top_k`. Phase 8 closes the "anyone can ingest" hole but the corpus itself is still shared (every authenticated user sees every document). Needed before multi-tenant exposure.
