- **`@clerk/testing` integration** — a real Clerk testing instance with `setupClerkTestingToken()` would let the Playwright suite exercise the real auth path end-to-end (instead of bypassing). Trade-off: requires a Clerk dev account as a test dependency. Deferred until CI exists.
- **`/admin` role gating** — Phase 8 just requires *any* signed-in user to reach `/admin`. There's no `is_admin` flag, so any authenticated user can ingest. Comes with the user-ownership / RBAC work.

